`pronoun: the five-day limb in the Law, as the 2026 instrument replaces the words` MEANS
    `A pronoun in replacement words` WITH
        `the replacement words are in` IS "Sefer HaChukim 3525, printed p. 563, section 5(2): the words 'שהיא הוצאה לחופשה ללא תשלום' inserted in paragraph (2ג)(א) of section 9(ג) of the Law as section 3(1) of the 2026 law quotes it"
        `the nouns the head of the paragraph names` IS LIST `masculine`, `feminine`
        `the gender of the pronoun and its verb` IS `feminine`
        `limb (a) was read from` IS `the consolidation only`
        `limb (b) was read from` IS `the official instrument, read from its page image; that no later instrument touched the words is CONSOLIDATION-ONLY`

